## SESSION INTENT

Analyze the `regional_sales.csv` dataset to identify volume anomalies. Specifically, calculate the 24-month rolling mean of `units` for each `(region, product_line)` combination, determine the ratio of monthly units to this rolling mean, and extract the top 3 anomalies (highest ratios) along with their return rates. The results are to be saved to CSV files for further reporting.

